<title>JAPAN: Japan May coincident index likely above 50 -- EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan May coincident index likely above 50 -- EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's diffusion index of coincident economic indicators is likely to be above the so-called boom-or-bust mark of 50 in May, although the index of leading indicators is likely to be below 50 for a fifth month in a row, an official of the Economic Planning Agency told reporters on Friday.</p>
</text>
